# Master Piandao {4}{W} 4/4 first strike: "Whenever Master Piandao attacks, look at the top four cards of your library. You may
# reveal an Ally, Equipment, or Lesson card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library
# in a random order." Each attack sees only four cards (the draw for the turn comes off the top first) and takes one:
# turn 3 sees Kyoshi Warriors (an Ally), Grizzly Bears, Bark of Doran (an Equipment) and an Island - Bears and the Island are
# refused, so are two cards at once and Invasion Reinforcements (an Ally in fifth place) - and takes the Equipment; turn 5 sees
# Accumulate Wisdom (a Lesson), takes it and leaves the others; turn 7 sees Savannah Lions and Aang, Swift Savior (an Ally).
# Bot2 has an Ally and an Equipment in its library, which stay there.

